                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As of October 2026, this game treads between Abandonware and Occasional development (if you consider the small bugfixes as development). It is also extremely overpriced to what it offer. Do not expect any public lobbies so you'll have to either convince or buy a copy for your friend which makes it even more insanely expensive.\r\n\r\nEarly access for years without any meaningful path forward, insanely overpriced makes this something I do not recommend people to buy unless you find it on sale (90%).\r\n\r\nPretty fun game with a friend though,\r\nThe concept is good and is maybe worth around 5 $ price point solely due to the lack of any development",
